    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Try the Demo</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/3143eb8b6e382e2ae6d06daeb0f19264.avif?t=1754003582\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Memory's Reach demo</strong> provides over two hours of gameplay and features puzzles, lore, and hidden secrets from select areas throughout the full game. Try it out and let us know your thoughts in the Community forums!</p></p><br><h1>Plays great on Steam Deck</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/26a3804453c75dc7c5a0634e94748780.avif?t=1754003582\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Deck is fully supported, including such features as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom default settings for a pre-tuned experienced the first time you jump in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">UI and font scaling to read better on the smaller screen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A collection of custom tweaks that include things like increased zoom on puzzles so they fill more of the screen. Toggleable using the &quot;Handheld Mode&quot; setting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Read more about Steam Deck support in the Community Forums.</strong></p></p><br><h1>Plays Great With Gamepads</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing with a gamepad is the ideal way to experience Memory's Reach, and the game fully supports a wide range of <strong>Xbox, PlayStation, and Switch Pro gamepads</strong>. And if you're a PC purist keyboard and mouse is of course fully supported as well.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore labyrinthian megastructures, solve mind-bending puzzles, and wield fantastic alien technology in a puzzling metroidvania adventure. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">An Ancient Treasure on a Long-lost Planet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Armed with nothing more than old star charts and dubious rumors, travel to the long-lost planet Virishal. Explore a world of towering megastructures and overgrown ruins - a civilization wiped out in a great cataclysm. Its monuments now reclaimed by steaming jungles, buried in crumbling mineshafts, and falling to ruin in slowly decaying orbits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Somewhere on this world is hidden the ancient treasure of the Mairi, sealed away eons ago to protect it from the great cataclysm. Explore Virishal and locate the treasure - but beware what other perilous secrets lie sleeping beneath the planet's surface!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/234e0f2945e97cc8dd1af4df72691415.poster.avif?t=1754003582\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/234e0f2945e97cc8dd1af4df72691415.webm?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/234e0f2945e97cc8dd1af4df72691415.mp4?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discover Powerful New Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventure to serene floating cities, immense underground structures, and perilous orbital space stations. The world slowly expands as you solve puzzles and acquire powerful new abilities. Use your powers to open pathways through previously inaccessible areas, overcome once insurmountable obstacles, reveal hidden secrets, and solve new kinds of puzzles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/703d26d76f3fd91873d8509fa80079a0.poster.avif?t=1754003582\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/703d26d76f3fd91873d8509fa80079a0.webm?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/703d26d76f3fd91873d8509fa80079a0.mp4?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve Arcane Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colossal machines begin to wake as you solve challenging holo-puzzles and take command of powerful alien technology. Shifting walls, energy beams, and other bizarre mechanisms form massive, interconnected puzzle rooms - use all of the tools at your disposal to solve intricate puzzles that will put your logical and spatial reasoning skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/e4e0fe25d3033159d0b120a287016873.poster.avif?t=1754003582\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/e4e0fe25d3033159d0b120a287016873.webm?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/e4e0fe25d3033159d0b120a287016873.mp4?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reveal A Cosmic Legacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aeons ago a cataclysmic event brought an end to an advanced civilization. Centuries later rumours of an ancient treasure draw you, an interstellar treasure hunter, in search of their desolate world. Scan the environment for lore, locate hidden relics, and piece together scattered data fragments to uncover the devastating history of an extinct people, and reveal the legacy of a doomed civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/e32256a2f15b1593057b0900820c3e61.poster.avif?t=1754003582\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/e32256a2f15b1593057b0900820c3e61.webm?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/e32256a2f15b1593057b0900820c3e61.mp4?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More to come!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Memory's Reach</i> is the second title from indie studio <i>100 Stones Interactive</i> and is currently under development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try the <strong>Demo</strong>, <strong>Wishlist now</strong> and be sure to hit the <strong>Follow button</strong> and visit the <strong>Community Hub</strong> for news and updates as the game develops!</p>",
