s of puzzles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/703d26d76f3fd91873d8509fa80079a0.poster.avif?t=1754003582\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/703d26d76f3fd91873d8509fa80079a0.webm?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/703d26d76f3fd91873d8509fa80079a0.mp4?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve Arcane Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Colossal machines begin to wake as you solve challenging holo-puzzles and take command of powerful alien technology. Shifting walls, energy beams, and other bizarre mechanisms form massive, interconnected puzzle rooms - use all of the tools at your disposal to solve intricate puzzles that will put your logical and spatial reasoning skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/e4e0fe25d3033159d0b120a287016873.poster.avif?t=1754003582\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/e4e0fe25d3033159d0b120a287016873.webm?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/e4e0fe25d3033159d0b120a287016873.mp4?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reveal A Cosmic Legacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aeons ago a cataclysmic event brought an end to an advanced civilization. Centuries later rumours of an ancient treasure draw you, an interstellar treasure hunter, in search of their desolate world. Scan the environment for lore, locate hidden relics, and piece together scattered data fragments to uncover the devastating history of an extinct people, and reveal the legacy of a doomed civilization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/e32256a2f15b1593057b0900820c3e61.poster.avif?t=1754003582\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/e32256a2f15b1593057b0900820c3e61.webm?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2126810/extras/e32256a2f15b1593057b0900820c3e61.mp4?t=1754003582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More to come!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Memory's Reach</i> is the second title from indie studio <i>100 Stones Interactive</i> and is currently under development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try the <strong>Demo</strong>, <strong>Wishlist now</strong> and be sure to hit the <strong>Follow button</strong> and visit the <strong>Community Hub</strong> for news and updates as the game develops!</p>",
    "short_description": "Memory\u2019s Reach is a first person puzzle-adventure metroidvania. Explore labyrinthian megastructures, solve mind-bending puzzles, and wield fantastic alien technology in a quest to reveal the legacy of a doomed civilization.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cA Metroid Prime with no combat, thoughtful puzzles and an interesting story? Hook it into my veins. I played Memory\u2019s Reach on Friday and it remained my game of PAX for the remainder of the show.\u201d<br>Kotaku AU - PAX Aus 2023: Renee\u2019s Annual Indie Roundup<br><br>\u201cFor those that love the Metroid style of slowly expanding a map and doubling back with upgraded abilities, Memory\u2019s Reach can scratch that itch. It\u2019s also got some of the most striking 3D visuals of any game at the show.\u201d<br>Kotaku AU - PAX Aus 2023: David\u2019s Indie Demo Picks<br>",
